WEBVTT

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.340
"Monday, June 13th"

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:14.840
...harder.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.680
"Packing Tape"

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.390
Have to work... harder.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.810
"Blue Tarp"

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.690
I have to work harder...

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.860
I have to work much, much harder.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.950
So much harder.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:07.040
"Higurashi: When They Cry SOTSU"

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:09.540
"Tuesday, June 14th"

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:19.760
Oof...

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.050
Morning, Reina.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.760
Morning, Dad.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:27.060
Here, have some water.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.440
Hey, thanks.

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.070
So, Reina,

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:40.490
what are you going to do with
those things from the hardware store?

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:41.410
Huh?

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:45.660
Oh, I just saw a bag from
the hardware store in your room.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.290
You went all the way out
to Okinomiya for that, right?

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.460
Oh, right...

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:55.170
I found this really cute statue
out at the dam construction dump,

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:59.590
and it's super big, so I needed
some stuff to help bring it home.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:04.640
Okay. Guess our little garden display's
gonna get bigger, then...

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.640
Don't hurt yourself now, okay?

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.350
Okay. You don't have
to worry about me, Dad.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.700
No one will find these here.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.880
What is taking Rena so long?

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.210
Keiichi-kun!

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:39.760
Morning!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:42.090
There you are. Way to be late, Rena!

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.850
Sorry! I hope you weren't waiting long!

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:49.520
I sure was! A few seconds more
and I would've totally ditched you.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:54.650
But you promised you'd <i>never </i>ditch me!

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.520
But I also said I'd ditch you
in a heartbeat if you were late.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:01.860
You're so mean, Keiichi-kun!

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:05.450
I know I said you should sleep in
every now and then,

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:08.040
but I didn't think you actually <i>would</i>.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.540
Yeah. You never sleep in, Rena.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:14.790
My, you slept in this morning?
How slovenly!

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:19.460
If you sleep in too long with your
belly out, you'll get a tummyache!

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.510
I didn't sleep in, promise!

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.970
I just had to do some stuff this morning.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:26.550
What had you so busy?

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.350
We can help out if you want!

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:35.190
No, it's something I have to do by myself.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:38.900
All right. I know you'll
be able to handle it, Rena.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:41.070
Chin up, okay?

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.110
Yep, thanks!

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:46.740
Oh, also, I can't do club today...

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.830
Is it okay if I take the afternoon off?

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:52.910
Well, if you're gonna be busy,
then I can't say you gotta come.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:56.830
The weather report said
we might get rain, too,

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.790
so let's just call it off for today.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.550
After all, club's no fun
without everyone here.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:03.260
Sorry!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.720
"Hinamizawa School"

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:21.150
"Trash Bags"

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:24.320
"Odor-Away"

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:00.150
Hello there.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.570
Sorry for dropping by unannounced.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:09.660
So, uh, are you Reina-chan?

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:13.870
Oh, jeez, how do I even start...

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:18.330
I'm friends with your dad.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:22.840
Oh, right! I should
introduce myself first. Yeah.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:26.760
I know who you are.
You're Rina Mamiya-san.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.550
So you <i>do </i>know me.

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:32.100
Uh-huh. My dad says you're really great.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:36.100
Your dad's really great too, Reina-chan.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.100
Thank you.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.360
What do you need from him here, though?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:44.480
I didn't really need anything.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.940
Your dad talks so much about you,

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:50.360
I thought I might come meet you myself.

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:54.240
So you came here to see me? Oh, yay!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:58.000
I've actually been wanting
to meet you, too.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.580
So you're happy I'm here!

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:05.050
I'm really glad to hear that.
I'd hoped we could be friends.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:10.380
I know! Could you help me
look for treasure, Rina-san?

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:14.300
Look for treasure? That sounds fun.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.810
Yeah! It's a little bit of a walk, though.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:20.560
Is it far away?
I hope it doesn't start raining.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:24.230
The weather report
said it's not gonna rain.

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:26.730
Really! Okay, then.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:29.860
I'll come help. It'll be a good chance
for us to get to know each other.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:35.780
Yay! Wait here, then.
I need to get some stuff!

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.580
Thanks for waiting.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.380
What's that?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.180
Just something we'll need to dig up
the treasure we're after!

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.680
Wow, this is serious business!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:57.260
Let's go, Rina-san!

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.650
Wow, Reina-chan.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:07.770
Do you come here a lot?
With your friends, I assume?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.570
No, I come here by myself!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:15.660
Interesting hobby for a teenage girl...

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:19.750
Sheesh, never knew they dumped
this much garbage here...

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.750
What kind of treasure are we looking for?

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.960
Reina-chan? Hello?

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:31.420
Oh, sorry! I couldn't hear you.
Maybe the wind's blowing too hard.

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:35.800
Oh.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:41.770
Don't tell anyone,
but this is my secret hideout.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:46.610
Wow, it's so cute!
You've got a little secret base out here!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.400
That's right.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:53.530
Nobody comes here, and nobody
can hear what happens here, either.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:59.870
Well, I feel honored that you'd
take me to such a special place.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.960
So what are we looking for again?

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:08.670
I worked really hard to get
all the right tools stored here.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:10.500
Let me get them.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:14.170
Sure, that makes sense.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:15.970
Can I come in?

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.470
Please wait outside, Rina-san.

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.570
This is so cool!

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:35.570
It really is like a little secret base!
You even have cushions!

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.570
You could totally sleep in here, huh?

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:40.120
I thought I told you to wait outside.

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.910
I would, but it just started raining.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:46.540
Can't trust that weatherman, huh?

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:47.710
Oh!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.170
Does this lamp work?

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:57.680
Yeah. They never shut off
the electricity from the dam work.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:09.150
Look, Reina-chan,
I should've mentioned this earlier...

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.650
Mentioned what?

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:13.980
You should know about your dad and I.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.570
I said he was my friend, right?

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:20.410
Well, he's actually my customer
at this club where we drink alcohol.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:21.910
I know.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:27.500
My dad always comes home
stinking of booze.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:33.340
Right. Of course you'd know--
you're his daughter and you live with him.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:39.430
I was also raised by a single parent,
so when I heard about you, I just...

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.390
I know I have no right
to ask this of you...

00:10:43.430 --> 00:10:47.180
But I feel really guilty
about him coming to the club.

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:52.610
Could you say something to him
and convince him to stop coming?

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:59.070
Yeah, I really have no right
asking you to handle it, do I?

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:03.530
But I'll help, too.
I'll stay away from him.

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:07.290
Could you help?
It'll be good for you, too.

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.960
Reina-chan?

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.130
I understand what you're
trying to say, Rina-san.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.500
Good.

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:19.510
You're kinda hurting me, Reina-chan.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.760
Y-You're hurting me!

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:29.140
You might have my dad fooled,
but you can't fool me!

00:11:29.140 --> 00:11:30.690
What? No...

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.280
I'm doing what's right!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:39.320
I'm doing what needs to be done
to make sure everyone's happy!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.360
My life story is all about
how hard I worked!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.370
so I need to work much, much, <i>much </i>harder!

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:19.190
No!

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:38.500
Help! Please, somebody help!

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.900
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:06.160
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.910
Don't kill me. Don't kill me.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.990
Don't kill me, don't kill me...

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.290
Don't kill me, don't kill me...

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:16.630
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.300
Rena-san...

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:07.760
If you can convince
Rika to stay in Hinamizawa,

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:12.680
I promise that you'll be happy
in that perfect world.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.650
Now I gotta...

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:35.000
See, Dad? This time, I put in the effort.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:38.040
I got rid of the bad people
who wanted to hurt our family!

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.840
I gotta hide her.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.010
So nobody finds her.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.890
"Wednesday, June 15th"

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.480
All right, school is finally over!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:09.450
Let's get game club started!
Any objections?

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.780
--Nope!
--Nope!

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:13.280
Since the gang's all here...
Wait, what's up, Rena?

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:16.370
Sorry, Mii-chan, I have
to do stuff again today!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.160
Man, again?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.670
Yeah, sorry!

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:24.210
You leave all the time
to go to work, too, Mion!

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:29.470
Yeah, I just can't say no
when my Uncle asks for my help.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.140
I'll give it everything I've got,
and when I'm finished,

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.680
when everything is back to the way it was,
I'll be back, I promise!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:39.940
Dunno what you've gotta do,
but we'll be here waiting.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.860
This old fart and all your friends
are in your corner!

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.690
Right. See you tomorrow!

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:51.240
I think I know what Rena's up to...

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:54.030
Really? You do?

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:55.080
Mm-hmm.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.290
Good, she's still here.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:10.050
Yo, Rena! Working up a sweat?

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.220
Keiichi-kun?! Why are you here?!

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:19.140
I received word of an emergency
in the area and rushed to the scene!

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:21.060
Where's the man in need
of grave assistance?!

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.980
Huh?! What?! An emergency?!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:28.230
Yes, a report about a Kenta-kun statue
buried deep in a pile of trash?

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:32.860
O-Oh! C'mon, Keiichi-kun, you scared me!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:36.910
I'm just messing around.
I promised I'd help, remember?

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.450
You came all the way here for me?

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.080
So where's that Kenta-kun at?

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.340
Over here!

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.260
Down there?

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:51.880
Yeah.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.400
Man, I wish we had an axe
or a saw or something.

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.520
It's fine, Keiichi-kun!

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:11.820
I don't mind, Rena. You want it, right?

00:17:16.450 --> 00:17:18.990
O-Okay, let's take a break.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:24.120
H-Hey, let me go get us some barley tea!
My house is super close!

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:33.130
He saw. Keiichi-kun saw.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:36.300
He saw, he saw, he saw, he saw!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.970
Keiichi-kun knows!

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.640
What should I do?
What should I do? What should I <i>do</i>?!

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:46.770
I know. I just have to work even <i>harder</i>.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:05.160
"Weekly News"
"Construction Worker Lynched,
Murdered, and Dismembered
at Hinamizawa Dam Construction Site"

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:09.790
"At the construction site for
the planned Hinamizawa Dam,

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:14.050
a construction worker was lynched,
murdered, then dismembered"?!

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:16.510
I knew it! Something did happen!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:24.220
"The assailants, armed with hatchets
and pickaxes, murdered the victim,

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:27.440
then used an axe to sever the head,
arms, and legs from the corpse."

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:41.280
I-I'm so sorry! Did I scare you? Did I?

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.700
N-No.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:48.040
H-Hey, Keiichi-kun! Remember how
you said you wish you had a saw?

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.170
I brought something that might help!

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:56.300
Oh. Sorry, I guess I kinda overreacted.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:02.390
No, it's okay!
I'm sorry to scare you, so sorry!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:05.930
I'm really glad you brought it,
but it's getting pretty dark.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.560
We should probably call it here today.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.940
Yeah...

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:13.150
Don't worry, Rena!
We can come back tomorrow!

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.980
You wanna help me again?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.780
Why wouldn't I?

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:19.200
Thank you, Keiichi-kun!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:24.030
I'm gonna bring Kenta-kun home!

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:35.750
Oh, hey there, Rena-chan!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.670
Oh, Keiichi's mom! Hello!

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:41.050
Shopping for dinner?

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:44.180
And for tomorrow's lunch, yeah.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.430
You're such a good kid, Rena-chan!

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:49.180
Keiichi couldn't cook to save his life.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:54.520
If I ever have to stay late at work,
I might ask you to cook for him!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.480
Sure, ma'am!

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:13.130
Excuse me, there.
Are you Ryugu-san? Reina Ryugu-san?

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:16.210
Yes, and you are?

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:22.970
Oh, good. Why don't we talk
in my car? It's pretty hot out.

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:28.060
I've got air conditioning in my car.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:35.730
Tell me if it's too cold, okay?
I like to blast it.

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:38.070
What do you want from me?

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:41.450
Do you know this woman?

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:44.200
Yes, that's Rina Mamiya-san.

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:47.030
Ah, that would be her club name.

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:50.250
Her real name is Ritsuko Mamiya-san.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:52.790
Did something happen with Rina-san?

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.960
Yes, she's been missing since yesterday.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:59.760
--Since yesterday?
--Does that ring any bells?

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:02.800
She came to our house yesterday.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.640
See, I thought so.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:09.220
Her coworkers told me
she'd gone to Hinamizawa

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:13.100
to visit the daughter
of one of her customers...

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:16.520
We're trying to retrace her steps.

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:19.480
I don't know what happened
after she stopped by.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:22.320
We talked for a little bit,
and then she left.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:26.870
I see. What were you talking about,
if you don't mind telling me?

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:31.410
Rina-san wanted to be my friend because
we were both raised by single parents.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:32.960
That's it.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.710
Is that so?

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.170
Well, if you think of anything else,

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:40.460
call the Okinomiya Police
and ask for Ooishi.

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:41.920
Okay.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:47.590
It's almost time
for Watanagashi, isn't it?

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:51.640
I hope we get a reprieve this year.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:55.230
From Oyashiro-isama's curse, I mean.

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.320
Have a good night.
